{"parse": {"title": "天穹的答音", "pageid": 4545, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"天穹的答音\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/ba/Item-170303.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"天穹的答音\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>天穹的答音</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#170303</div></div><hr /><div>一段过往的掠影，一些时代的片段，一份珍贵的纪念。谨以此物，为见证诸多故事的朋友们献上诚挚的敬意。<br />可于个人信息界面作为头像使用。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">古老的天文台坐落在这里，它是“邮筒”，也是“灯塔”。\n每当仰望天空，我都能得到回应，一如无数先辈。</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "天穹的答音"}}